<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Material Reset</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="98.974%" size="6" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from the</span> <i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>tree context menu &gt; Material &gt; Reset</b></span></i><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
